cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "kirsolve: cross-tool resolution of ambiguous KIR allele calls"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chaves
    given-names: Tiago Fernando
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  kirsolve reconciles KIR allele calls from PING and kir-mapper, reducing
  ambiguity through cross-tool intersection, copy-number constraints and
  resolution-level collapsing, and separates deterministic results from
  model-based inference.
keywords:
  - KIR
  - immunogenetics
  - allele calling
  - PING
  - kir-mapper
references:
