        given-names: Erick C.
    title: "kir-mapper: A Toolkit for KIR Genotyping From Short-Read Second-Generation Sequencing Data"
    journal: HLA
    year: 2025
    doi: 10.1111/tan.70092
  - type: article
    authors:
